tweak_constants`.\n\n6. **Fixed one bug** in the haraka FFI wrapper where it wrote SPX_N bytes instead of always 32 (matching C `haraka512`).\n\n7. **Verified symbol parity** for all 48 configs via `check_syms.sh`. All Rust `.so` files export every symbol that the matching C `.so` files export.\n\n8. **All tests pass for all 48 feature combinations** (`test_all_v2.sh` showed `Total pass=48 fail=0`)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":690,"cache_read_input_tokens":279199,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":690,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c9169a7d-325a-4e19-9af5-5c6ed8898127","uuid":"499b226c-743e-4d25-997d-33396274ec78"}
